---
import { ArrowUpRight } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<footer class="w-full border-t border-border/50 px-6 pb-8 pt-16 md:px-20 lg:pt-24">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 md:grid-cols-12">
    <section class="md:col-span-5">
      <h2 class="font-bodoni-moda text-3xl font-medium">Essence</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-md leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
        Conceito digital para um estúdio fictício dedicado à beleza natural e à sofisticação editorial.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary">
        Projeto acadêmico demonstrativo
      </p>
    </section>

    <nav class="md:col-span-3" aria-label="Links do rodapé">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold">NAVEGAÇÃO</h2>
      <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-muted-foreground">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-primary">O Studio</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services" class="hover:text-primary">Serviços</a></li>
        <li><a href="/scheduling" class="hover:text-primary">Demonstração</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <section class="md:col-span-4">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold">TRANSPARÊNCIA</h2>
      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-col items-start gap-3 text-muted-foreground">
        <button data-modal="privacy" class="cursor-pointer hover:text-primary">Privacidade</button>
        <button data-modal="terms" class="cursor-pointer hover:text-primary">Sobre o projeto</button>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/guilhermesoaresf/essence-beauty-studio"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-primary"
        >
          Código no GitHub <ArrowUpRight size={16} aria-hidden="true" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <p class="mx-auto mt-14 max-w-7xl border-t border-border/50 pt-6 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
    © 2026 Essence Beauty Studio — conceito fictício desenvolvido por Guilherme Soares, Lucas André e Moisés Ferreira.
  </p>
</footer>
